---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import ContactIcon from './ContactIcon.astro';
import AboutPhoto from './AboutPhoto.astro';
import AboutIllustration from './AboutIllustration.astro';
import {qualificationEmail,visitEmail} from '../data/aboutEditorial';
import '../styles/about-redesign.css';
---
<Layout title="Contact LZZ Precision in Hangzhou" description="Email or WhatsApp LZZ Precision about custom CNC parts. Find the Hangzhou address, prepare a drawing-based inquiry or arrange a workshop visit." cta={false} articleImage="/media/about-redesign-20261014/inquiry-parts-1200.webp">
 <article class="al-page al-contact"><div class="al-wrap">
  <header class="al-hero al-contact-hero"><div><h1>Let’s discuss<br/>your part.</h1><p class="al-lead">Send the drawing and the requirements that matter to your assembly. For supplier documents or a workshop visit, tell us what you would like to review.</p><dl class="al-contact-details"><div><dt>Email</dt><dd><a href="mailto:roger@lzz-cnc.com"><ContactIcon kind="email"/>roger@lzz-cnc.com</a></dd></div><div><dt>WhatsApp</dt><dd><a href="https://wa.me/8613858102479"><ContactIcon kind="phone"/>+86 138 5810 2479</a></dd></div><div><dt>Location & time zone</dt><dd>Hangzhou, China · UTC+8</dd></div></dl></div><AboutIllustration kind="inquiry" eager/></header>
  <section class="al-section al-inquiry" aria-labelledby="al-inquiry-title"><div><h2 id="al-inquiry-title">Prepare a machining inquiry</h2><p>A consistent drawing package helps us review the machining scope and quote the requirements you will use to accept the parts.</p><a class="al-inline-link" href="/resources/ordering/rfq-checklist/">Check what to include with your RFQ</a></div><div><ul><li>Current drawing revision and 3D model where available</li><li>Material grade, finish and required quantity</li><li>Critical dimensions, fits and inspection records</li><li>Delivery destination and requested arrival date</li></ul><a class="al-primary" href="/quote/">Prepare RFQ email</a><p class="al-small" style="margin-top:16px">Create a draft, then attach drawings and send it from your email app.</p></div></section>
  <section class="al-section" aria-labelledby="al-location-title"><header class="al-section-head"><h2 id="al-location-title">Visit the workshop in Hangzhou</h2><p>Arrange your visit with us before travelling so we can agree the date and the parts or processes you would like to discuss.</p></header><div class="al-address-panel"><AboutPhoto id="workshop-wide" caption="LZZ machining workshop · Hangzhou"/><div><p>Hangzhou Lizhizao Precision Machinery Co., Ltd.</p><address>No. 4 Fengcheng Road<br/>Pingyao, Yuhang District<br/>Hangzhou, Zhejiang, China</address><a class="al-secondary" href={visitEmail}>Arrange a workshop visit</a></div></div></section>
  <section class="al-section" aria-labelledby="al-contact-support"><header class="al-section-head"><h2 id="al-contact-support">Supplier review or an existing order</h2><p>Choose the information you need, then include the project or order reference in your message.</p></header><div class="al-contact-routes"><article><h3>Company and quality-system documents</h3><p>Request the current ISO 9001 certificate and scope. For order-specific records, identify the reports or material documents your team requires.</p><nav class="al-actions"><a class="al-inline-link" href={qualificationEmail}>Request supplier documents</a><a class="al-inline-link" href="/about/company-profile/#documents">Read the document archive</a></nav></article><article><h3>Changes, acceptance or a part discrepancy</h3><p>Include the drawing revision, order or batch reference, affected quantity and supporting photographs or measurements.</p><a class="al-inline-link" href="/about/how-we-work/#section-2">Review order and after-sales responsibilities</a></article></div></section>
 </div></article>
</Layout>
